Beyond the usual disclaimer, one thing is worth stating plainly:

This repository is not tax advice, legal advice, or a compliance certification.
Tax rates, invoice thresholds and mandatory receipt fields change, and they
change without notice to software vendors. As of the last update, no entry here
has been confirmed against a primary source; items researched against secondary
sources are marked "confirmed-secondary" in data/verification-queue.json, which
is not the same as verified.

Confirm every figure against the authority named in the file before relying on
it. Several rates carry known expiry dates and will be wrong after them.
